I am changing my review to NO.
Why would I change my review to no if this is a great game?
Because the developers think I am an idiot, they released a new version with updates and want to charge it as a new game.
If the developer released another DLC or a new game, I would buy it on sight, now... I don't think so.
Original review below...
This game worth the money, buy it.
Pros:
+ beautiful enviroment, details, night and day cycles;
+ good play, nice mechanics, hand weapons and firing weapons;
+ looks like an actual city, road, cards, restaurants, houses, stores and real stuff;
+ zombies that looks like zombies and an AI for zombies, they listen and see, so avoid noise and stay out of they view;
+ some resource management, so it is more than a FPS zombie, now you have a community;
+ it will make you feel a different experience every time you play;
+ nice story, it is not just grab a club and a gun to save the world from zombies;
+ good DLCs;
Cons:
- repeat missions, but they are actually different because of the place and players, perhaps after 50 hoursof game play I got a little bored;

This is an amazing game, let me tell you why;
I've been following his developer on his live stream since he started working on stratO and the greatest thing I can say is he has accomplished to create a really hard flying game, it's learning curve is really sharp but once you get used to it it will give you some kind of feeling.
For me, that feeling is tranquility, I start playing it with some drum n' bass music on the background and I can easily play for two hours without stop. It's just the flow it achieves that makes it so great.

